Review this change. File: `src/main/java/com/acme/inventory/InventoryService.java`. What the change does: Spring Boot 3 singleton service with Spring Data JPA. Checkout calls reserveAll for every order line in one go; if any line is out of stock, none of the lines may stay reserved. Many checkouts run at once. The Stock entity has no @Version field. Reservations expire after 15 minutes; the table holds millions of rows. Gift-card orders can be split between several payers.

